  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41159762",
      "title": "Adding an Image Preview to the Picker",
      "lectureOrder": 117,
      "videoOrder": 110,
      "sourceHash": "2b47eb52aa1828c5117beb3882c3ec850ab3fbaa52213b7eb8acb8bb1777436f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 3.63,
          "en": "Now, to show a preview of the picked image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.63,
          "end": 8.63,
          "en": "we need to handle the event that an image was picked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.94,
          "end": 13.17,
          "en": "and then store some state so that we can update this UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.17,
          "end": 15.933,
          "en": "and show a preview as soon as we have an image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.34,
          "end": 20.67,
          "en": "So we need some state here in this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.67,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "and therefore, we need to use state hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 25.47,
          "en": "This would require us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 28.14,
          "en": "to turn this component into a client component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.14,
          "end": 31.833,
          "en": "but we already did this here, so no changes are needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 34.44,
          "en": "Now here with this state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 37.17,
          "en": "I then wanna manage the picked image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 39.315,
          "en": "so I'll name this picked image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.315,
          "end": 43.173,
          "en": "and have a set picked image state updating function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.79,
          "end": 49.17,
          "en": "And now we need a second event handler function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 53.49,
          "en": "that could be called handle image change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.49,
          "end": 54.99,
          "en": "which should be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 58.26,
          "en": "whenever this input here has a new value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.26,
          "end": 61.803,
          "en": "so whenever the change event on that input is emitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.15,
          "end": 66.42,
          "en": "And therefore, we should add the on change prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.42,
          "end": 69.483,
          "en": "and set handle image change as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 74.16,
          "en": "Now, here in handle image change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.16,
          "end": 77.28,
          "en": "we'll then automatically get an event object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.28,
          "end": 78.81,
          "en": "as you always do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 82.28999999999999,
          "en": "for those event handling functions in React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.28999999999999,
          "end": 84.36,
          "en": "and we can use this event object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.36,
          "end": 86.913,
          "en": "to get hold of that picked image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.53,
          "end": 90.27,
          "en": "We can get hold of that picked file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.27,
          "end": 93.57,
          "en": "by using event.target.files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.57,
          "end": 95.913,
          "en": "and then accessing the first file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 97.14,
          "end": 99.6,
          "en": "This file property will exist",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 103.14,
          "en": "because the target of this event is this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.14,
          "end": 106.25999999999999,
          "en": "and this file input object, under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.25999999999999,
          "end": 109.05,
          "en": "will have such a files property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 109.05,
          "end": 111.63,
          "en": "That will be an array of all the files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.63,
          "end": 112.86,
          "en": "that have been picked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.86,
          "end": 116.1,
          "en": "but here, it'll only be one file that can be picked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.1,
          "end": 119.7,
          "en": "and therefore. I'll just access that first file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.7,
          "end": 122.61,
          "en": "You could allow the user to pick multiple files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.61,
          "end": 126.93,
          "en": "by adding the multiple prop here to this file input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.93,
          "end": 129.81,
          "en": "but since we don't have that here and don't want it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.81,
          "end": 132.753,
          "en": "it'll only be one file that we can access.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.06,
          "end": 137.85,
          "en": "Now, it's possible that the user actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 140.01,
          "en": "did not pick a file for some reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.01,
          "end": 144.12,
          "en": "so I'll check if the file is undefined, if we got no file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 147.341,
          "en": "and in that case, I'll just return and not continue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.341,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "(paper crumpling)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.238,
          "en": "But if we make it past this if check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.238,
          "end": 153.363,
          "en": "we know that some file has been selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 157.47,
          "en": "Now, in order to show it as a preview here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.47,
          "end": 161.67000000000002,
          "en": "I now want to convert it into a so-called data URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.67000000000002,
          "end": 164.79,
          "en": "which is simply a value that can be used as an input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.79,
          "end": 166.86,
          "en": "for an image element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.86,
          "end": 170.523,
          "en": "so that can be used as a source for an image element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.75,
          "end": 174.84,
          "en": "And we can generate such a data URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.84,
          "end": 178.95,
          "en": "with help of a class built into JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.95,
          "end": 180.843,
          "en": "the file reader class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.95,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "We can construct such a file reader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.66,
          "en": "and then do what its name implies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.66,
          "end": 188.343,
          "en": "We can read our file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.42,
          "end": 194.42,
          "en": "and we can simply call file reader read as data URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 197.043,
          "en": "and pass that file to that method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 199.05,
          "end": 202.41,
          "en": "Now, this method works in a bit of a strange way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 205.59,
          "en": "because it doesn't actually return anything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 208.32,
          "en": "not a promise, not the read file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.32,
          "end": 211.23,
          "en": "and it also doesn't take a callback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.23,
          "end": 215.7,
          "en": "Instead, we get hold of that data URL that's being generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 219.99,
          "en": "by assigning a value to the on load property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.99,
          "end": 222.003,
          "en": "of this file reader object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 223.53,
          "end": 226.56,
          "en": "So we store a function as a value in on load,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 226.56,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "and this function will then be triggered by the file reader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 231.69,
          "en": "once this method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 231.69,
          "end": 234.753,
          "en": "this read as data URL method, is done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.92000000000002,
          "end": 240.78,
          "en": "But here, we then won't get the generated URL as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.78,
          "end": 245.78,
          "en": "Instead, we can access it by accessing fileReader.result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 250.293,
          "en": "and that will then be that generated URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.28,
          "end": 254.4,
          "en": "And that's what I then wanna store in my state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 254.4,
          "end": 258.27,
          "en": "So I will set my picked image to the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 258.27,
          "end": 261.66,
          "en": "of accessing fileReader.result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.66,
          "end": 263.853,
          "en": "inside of this on load function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 266.13,
          "end": 269.01,
          "en": "Well, and with that, we can then use this picked image state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.01,
          "end": 270.78,
          "en": "to show a preview.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 273.99,
          "en": "So down here, in this controls div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 273.99,
          "end": 278.823,
          "en": "I'll add another div with a class name of preview,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.05,
          "end": 282.09000000000003,
          "en": "and in that div, I now wanna check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 282.09000000000003,
          "end": 285.87,
          "en": "if we don't have a picked image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 285.87,
          "end": 288.65999999999997,
          "en": "in which case I'll simply output a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.65999999999997,
          "end": 293.463,
          "en": "where I say \"No image picked yet\" or something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.84000000000003,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "But if we do have a picked image, I wanna show that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 303.63,
          "en": "And for that, I'll use the image component provided by next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.63,
          "end": 307.98,
          "en": "so you should import that from next image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 307.98,
          "end": 310.32,
          "en": "and then here on that image,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 310.32,
          "end": 315.32,
          "en": "I'll set the source to my picked image, so to that data URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 320.6,
          "en": "and the alt text to \"The image selected by the user,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 322.32,
          "end": 324.24,
          "en": "and I'll add that fill prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.24,
          "end": 325.966,
          "en": "because I don't know the dimensions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.966,
          "end": 328.053,
          "en": "of that image in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 330.99,
          "end": 333.06,
          "en": "And that should then be all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 333.06,
          "end": 334.11,
          "en": "With that, we should have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 334.11,
          "end": 337.08,
          "en": "that finished image picker component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 337.08,
          "end": 338.73,
          "en": "and we can now take a look at it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 339.69,
          "end": 343.86,
          "en": "Here in this application, I now got this preview area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 343.86,
          "end": 346.8,
          "en": "and if I now click this button, the file picker opens up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 346.8,
          "end": 350.55,
          "en": "and if I pick an image, I can see that preview here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 350.55,
          "end": 352.77,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 352.77,
          "end": 355.23,
          "en": "And with that, we're now finally ready",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 355.23,
          "end": 358.14300000000003,
          "en": "to also work on the submission of this form.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
